    "detail": "I would like to review by category for others to consider this hotel. 1. Room - queen bed is cozy for a single person stay, even for non-asian body size, but if 2 person it is just nice for asian-size couple and it will be a little challenging for foreigner with large body. - Room is well-kept and clean, toilet comes with bathtub and water sprinkler level is great. - LCD TV is big enough to be viewed at any angle. - Best thing i like is the toiletries with extra complimentary goods like facial and hand lotion, shaver gel, and etc. - there are 2 USB port for charging devices which helps alot because for traveler who doesn't bring a universal charger and japan-type power port is more than enough (6-7 port) - Toilet seat can be turn on to be warm 2. Location - it is quiet due to far from city centre 3. Lounge - good for hangout, chat session. 4. There is a convenient store at B1 5. The only bad thing I don't like is the Laundry machine, not enough machines. ",
